","review_id":"3E_JEmYiiW62LDnDszX_uw","date":"2018-10-26T16:20:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9330878257751465,"text_excerpt":"This was a fun gay bar to check out. Unfortunately, I only visited this spot for a brief moment, and I believe it was before the \"busy\" times because it was not many people there. So I didn't get to see the \"full experience.\" However, my drinks were prepared great, most of the bartenders were very personable, and the facility was clean and organized. I loved the upstairs with a balcony to people watch over Bourbon Street."},{"business_id":"QCZD4h64f1QbTMn0MT-i5A","review_id":"c94AEyo1RXof074pPY9o3Q","date":"2019-10-31T19:18:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325834512710571,"text_excerpt":"I had a great time here. Loved the music the strippers and the drinks. They're are many gay bars/clubs on bourbon st . But this is the one to be at. It was packed and everyone was having A great time. So much fun."},{"business_id":"QCZD4h64f1QbTMn0MT-i5A","review_id":"aayA8PvTVDDiSTfPPrLhVg","date":"2015-06-04T01:06:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9318509101867676,"text_excerpt":"From what I can remember, I have fun when I come here ;). It's much more of a dance club than the Pub across the street. There's usually plenty of eye candy around and plenty of room to shake it if that's what you want to do. It's usually LOUD inside, as a dance club should be. Bartenders do a surprisingly good job of keeping the drinks flowing, even when it gets slammed. Cover charges are always reasonable, except when there's a big event going on (Pride, Decadence, etc.). Drinks are fairly priced considering the location and are usually pretty strong from my experience. Definitely a must-do if in the gayborhood."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QCZD4h64f1QbTMn0MT-i5A","photo_id":"Es2HPu6IsjRdUTxE6G7rRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Es2HPu6IsjRdUTxE6G7rRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999998807907104}]},"notebook_case":null}
